WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:04.270
For instance,
even if those arms of yours

00:04.270 --> 00:07.100
Become entwined in chains

00:07.100 --> 00:10.540
For instance,
even if this space we live in

00:10.540 --> 00:14.910
Someday will burn completely down

00:14.910 --> 00:21.040
Keep believing in hope, if nothing else

00:22.320 --> 00:26.580
In the shadows of glimmering stars

00:28.390 --> 00:32.660
There is a world governed by darkness

00:34.460 --> 00:38.960
Just one life that is out there

00:40.470 --> 00:45.740
If you keep it entrapped there,
lonely boy

00:46.540 --> 00:52.310
The reason that we met each other here

00:52.310 --> 00:58.650
Must surely exist

00:58.650 --> 01:01.920
For instance,
even if sorrow takes you

01:01.920 --> 01:04.860
And you're about to collapse under it

01:04.860 --> 01:08.200
For instance,
if my chest can become

01:08.200 --> 01:12.570
A power to hold you and keep you there

01:12.570 --> 01:16.970
I'm sure that even
tomorrow we can survive

01:37.160 --> 01:40.820
Is life something so fragile, so weak?

01:41.830 --> 01:42.820
Life is...

01:45.370 --> 01:46.900
...proof.

01:46.900 --> 01:49.240
Proof that you're alive...

01:49.240 --> 01:51.840
Hibiki's reason to exist...

01:51.840 --> 01:53.680
His proof of life.

01:53.680 --> 01:55.670
Hibiki's proof...

02:16.930 --> 02:18.730
Mr. Alien...

02:18.730 --> 02:20.330
Where did you go?

02:23.440 --> 02:24.640
Huh?

02:24.640 --> 02:25.630
That's...

02:30.380 --> 02:31.500
You dropped this.

02:35.820 --> 02:37.320
Mr. Alien!

02:37.320 --> 02:39.320
Hang on!

02:39.320 --> 02:40.450
Mr. Alien?

02:45.430 --> 02:47.030
Mr. Alien!

02:47.030 --> 02:48.030
Are you okay?

02:48.030 --> 02:49.700
Do you recognize me?

02:49.700 --> 02:51.560
I was really worried about you!

02:54.100 --> 02:57.810
I'll make you something
nutritious like last time.

02:57.810 --> 02:59.140
Oh, but before that...

03:03.850 --> 03:05.680
This isn't the time for this!

03:07.180 --> 03:09.450
What are you doing?
Hurry up after him!

03:09.450 --> 03:12.090
- Right!
- Oh wait, Mr. Alien!

03:12.090 --> 03:13.640
- Check your wounds!
- Dita!

03:15.190 --> 03:17.360
It's the same as ever...

03:17.360 --> 03:19.930
Whoa, what's this about?

03:19.930 --> 03:24.260
Sorry to tell you this, but we
can't let men run freely anymore.

03:25.630 --> 03:27.900
Did something happen to you guys?

03:31.140 --> 03:33.110
Hey, how is it?

03:33.110 --> 03:34.510
Can you make anything of it?

03:35.540 --> 03:38.910
We have to somehow make it
controllable without the men!

03:41.980 --> 03:44.590
Everyone, the tea is ready!

03:44.590 --> 03:47.210
Goodness, those girls really work hard.

03:49.790 --> 03:51.990
Old hag, I have to talk to you!

03:59.030 --> 04:00.000
Rabat?

04:00.000 --> 04:00.970
Yo!

04:01.940 --> 04:04.430
Hey now, all men are brothers, right?

04:07.610 --> 04:09.300
What are you doing here?

04:10.750 --> 04:14.750
And what did you guys do
to end up someplace like this?

04:14.750 --> 04:16.940
We're just waiting
for the storm to pass.

04:18.650 --> 04:20.320
Where's your partner?

04:20.320 --> 04:22.760
Well, that's a female...

04:22.760 --> 04:25.120
That's enough, stop!

04:27.760 --> 04:29.750
It's our turn next.

04:31.130 --> 04:33.290
I'm sure they'll come for us.

04:34.940 --> 04:37.340
Melanus fought to live on!

04:37.340 --> 04:39.770
They were nothing
like the guys on Anpathos!

04:40.810 --> 04:42.640
And as a result

04:42.640 --> 04:43.630
they all died.

04:45.110 --> 04:48.650
I don't want their deaths to go to waste!

04:48.650 --> 04:50.290
Is it the first time

04:50.290 --> 04:51.980
that you've seen someone die?

05:00.330 --> 05:03.320
And do you honestly think
we have a chance of winning?

05:12.840 --> 05:15.140
If we don't win,

05:15.140 --> 05:16.240
we'll die.

05:18.610 --> 05:21.380
This can't be won
with force alone, right?

05:23.720 --> 05:28.820
In either case, while we're debating,
it's useless to do anything.

05:32.260 --> 05:34.130
The results are already out.

05:34.130 --> 05:36.760
Get them before they get us!
That's the only way!

05:36.760 --> 05:37.730
That's right!

05:37.730 --> 05:42.840
We can prove that we can win
without the help of those men!

05:42.840 --> 05:45.570
But can we win with just the Dreads?

05:45.570 --> 05:47.740
It's not about whether we can or can't...

05:47.740 --> 05:49.180
We will!

05:49.180 --> 05:50.580
Isn't that right, girls?

05:50.580 --> 05:51.580
Yeah!

05:51.580 --> 05:53.820
Barnette's scary...

05:53.820 --> 05:58.650
If we win on our own, it'll be
a meaningful victory for Mejale!

05:58.650 --> 06:00.750
- Yeah!
- How silly.

06:03.360 --> 06:04.950
What do you mean by "silly"?

06:05.990 --> 06:10.670
What you're saying sounds
similar to the logic the men use.

06:10.670 --> 06:13.330
Ms. Gasco, don't mess things up now!

06:14.800 --> 06:16.960
Yeah, yeah, sorry to have bothered you.

06:32.120 --> 06:34.020
Stop already!

06:35.020 --> 06:36.960
Let go of me!

06:38.030 --> 06:39.360
You're horrible!

06:39.360 --> 06:41.790
Someone, help!

06:48.770 --> 06:51.070
I'm jealous of machines.

06:51.070 --> 06:53.340
They lack emotions,
so they don't have doubt.

06:53.340 --> 06:55.080
They always produce the same results.

06:55.080 --> 06:59.740
I'm jealous of people who can
create lots of different results.

07:00.750 --> 07:03.650
It's boring not to feel anything.

07:05.020 --> 07:08.020
If I could have a heart,
I'd want one.

07:08.020 --> 07:11.530
Feeling jealous or bored...

07:11.530 --> 07:13.660
You're human enough, Pyoro.

07:13.660 --> 07:16.430
That's because I'm still broken.

07:18.200 --> 07:19.770
I see...

07:19.770 --> 07:24.870
It's rather ironic that you're
like a human because you're broken.

07:24.870 --> 07:28.710
I feel jealous
because humans are beings

07:28.710 --> 07:31.510
that are forever incomplete.

07:34.350 --> 07:36.080
Where are you going?

07:37.350 --> 07:39.620
I'm going to do what I can right now.

07:39.620 --> 07:40.820
Hey.

07:40.820 --> 07:41.790
What's that?

07:42.760 --> 07:44.560
It's a big favor!

07:44.560 --> 07:46.090
What are you going to do?

07:46.090 --> 07:48.360
I'm going to fix Mr. Alien's partner.

07:48.360 --> 07:50.900
You're going to get
scolded again by Barnette.

07:50.900 --> 07:51.890
I don't care!

07:57.140 --> 07:58.470
Sheesh...

07:58.470 --> 08:00.480
I'm really busy right now...

08:00.480 --> 08:03.850
If you're bored, can you clean
up that toolbox over there?

08:03.850 --> 08:06.410
I won't need it until tomorrow.

08:06.410 --> 08:08.470
Thanks, Parfet!

08:15.860 --> 08:17.090
Why me...

08:17.090 --> 08:18.760
Yo, spiky-head.

08:18.760 --> 08:20.190
You awake yet?

08:20.190 --> 08:21.660
You have me to thank.

08:21.660 --> 08:24.830
I picked you up out of
the dump that was Melanus.

08:25.800 --> 08:27.670
- Damn you!
- Whoa.

08:27.670 --> 08:29.860
Why didn't you save
Seran and the others?

08:30.910 --> 08:32.910
They made no money.

08:32.910 --> 08:33.900
What?

08:38.680 --> 08:41.020
Shithead...

08:41.020 --> 08:42.310
Damn it...

08:43.520 --> 08:44.920
What should I do...

08:44.920 --> 08:46.790
What's this? Boring...

08:46.790 --> 08:48.460
You're rather cold-hearted.

08:48.460 --> 08:50.690
Is Hibiki worth something?

08:50.690 --> 08:52.830
What turns into money isn't him.

08:52.830 --> 08:55.560
He's just connected to a money tree.

08:58.730 --> 09:00.940
Linestar treatment shows no effects...

09:00.940 --> 09:02.400
The data is unstable.

09:03.370 --> 09:07.140
Oh no... It's out of control again...

09:07.140 --> 09:09.540
This is a waste of a treasure...

09:41.940 --> 09:43.680
This is Meia.

09:43.680 --> 09:44.800
Enemy sighted.

09:51.120 --> 09:53.550
I don't understand anymore!

09:54.860 --> 09:58.730
- It's so different from a Dread!
- Then, you should just stop!

09:58.730 --> 09:59.990
Pai?

09:59.990 --> 10:01.990
Hey, help me out!

10:03.160 --> 10:05.770
Mechanical injuries aren't my field.

10:05.770 --> 10:07.970
It's not mine either...

10:07.970 --> 10:13.570
Why do you give everything you
have when it comes to Hibiki?

10:13.570 --> 10:15.410
You've never had something like that?

10:17.810 --> 10:20.620
Like you're always
thinking about someone...

10:20.620 --> 10:23.250
You always chase them with your eyes

10:23.250 --> 10:25.410
and you always think about them.

10:26.520 --> 10:29.820
I think only about Mr. Alien.

10:29.820 --> 10:32.690
Ever since I first met him.

10:32.690 --> 10:35.990
But he always yells at you, Dita.

10:37.830 --> 10:38.820
That's true.

10:41.640 --> 10:43.970
I lose! Dita, you're strong!

10:49.440 --> 10:51.480
Confirming enemy approaching!

10:51.480 --> 10:53.510
Distance: 12,000!

10:53.510 --> 10:55.220
All hands, prepare for battle!

10:55.220 --> 10:56.550
Dread team, scramble!

10:56.550 --> 10:59.450
This isn't the time to be doing this!

11:00.690 --> 11:02.520
Looks like the monsters are here.

11:03.960 --> 11:06.760
I wonder if the women are
all right by themselves...

11:10.200 --> 11:13.430
We don't have the time to wait around!

11:13.430 --> 11:15.800
The pilot goes out in good condition...

11:15.800 --> 11:18.510
...does their work perfectly,
and comes safely back.

11:18.510 --> 11:20.670
Things are expected to go that way.

11:21.940 --> 11:24.210
That's what helping
out from backstage means.

11:25.550 --> 11:28.280
Ms. Gasco, enough with the logic.

11:28.280 --> 11:29.870
Just put my order through!

11:32.250 --> 11:34.450
Not much room to think, Barnette.

11:35.920 --> 11:37.450
Smile! Smile!

11:41.000 --> 11:41.980
Good.

11:42.730 --> 11:44.820
Well, I'll do what I need to.

11:45.830 --> 11:47.130
Perfectly!

11:51.840 --> 11:53.170
Do your best.

12:04.550 --> 12:05.990
When did you leave?

12:05.990 --> 12:08.150
I just came out to see the conditions.

12:09.160 --> 12:10.560
Can we win?

12:10.560 --> 12:11.650
With only us?

12:12.790 --> 12:14.460
Jura, take the A team.

12:14.460 --> 12:16.900
Barnette, I leave the B team to you.

12:16.900 --> 12:18.430
Roger.

12:18.430 --> 12:20.570
- Meia...
- What?

12:20.570 --> 12:24.540
I don't like losing on general principle.

12:24.540 --> 12:25.910
Neither do I.

12:25.910 --> 12:28.040
Good. I'm glad.

12:28.040 --> 12:31.110
Meia is returning to formation.

12:31.110 --> 12:34.120
The enemy ship is headed directly for us.

12:34.120 --> 12:36.180
BC, open a channel.

12:36.180 --> 12:38.350
It may be useless,
but let's try talking.

12:38.350 --> 12:39.750
Roger.

12:39.750 --> 12:42.020
- What?
- Parfet, are you all right?

12:43.790 --> 12:47.630
The Paksis Pragma isn't happy right now.

12:47.630 --> 12:48.960
Do you want to call Bart?

12:48.960 --> 12:50.360
You can't!

12:50.360 --> 12:52.230
We're going to do it on our own!

12:52.230 --> 12:54.970
If we rely on men, we lose!

12:54.970 --> 12:57.040
Girls, that's enough...

12:57.040 --> 12:59.510
Help!

12:59.510 --> 13:03.010
Stop it already!

13:03.010 --> 13:04.340
Help!

13:05.380 --> 13:06.640
BC, how's your end?

13:07.650 --> 13:09.240
No good. No reply.

13:10.580 --> 13:12.790
I guess we have to go in then...

13:12.790 --> 13:15.280
Captain! Someone!

13:16.990 --> 13:18.490
Good timing!

13:18.490 --> 13:19.520
Huh? What?

13:38.610 --> 13:40.950
Hey, come on, Parfet...

13:40.950 --> 13:43.780
Is this really all right?

13:43.780 --> 13:45.320
It'll be fine.

13:45.320 --> 13:47.450
I'm sure you can link up!

13:47.450 --> 13:48.520
Here we go.

13:48.520 --> 13:49.750
Switch on!

13:53.130 --> 13:54.690
I did it!

13:59.800 --> 14:01.600
I thought it would go well...

14:09.880 --> 14:13.010
You have no other reason to exist...

14:13.010 --> 14:15.280
...but to be parts for us.

14:15.280 --> 14:17.120
It's a message from the enemy!

14:17.120 --> 14:19.590
They've linked themselves
to Pyoro's system!

14:19.590 --> 14:22.590
Who is this "us" you talk
of and where do you come from?

14:22.590 --> 14:25.430
We are messengers from Earth.

14:25.430 --> 14:30.870
You are allowed to live only as
provisions for the Earth's future.

14:30.870 --> 14:32.170
The Earth?

14:32.170 --> 14:34.670
That's the planet
our ancestors came from.

14:34.670 --> 14:37.240
You need only follow your destiny.

14:37.240 --> 14:39.510
The act of denying the future to come

14:39.510 --> 14:41.810
is against the order of the Earth.

14:41.810 --> 14:45.380
If that is so,
the future of those who fight...

14:45.380 --> 14:47.070
...is destruction.

14:49.820 --> 14:51.820
Pyoro, are you all right?

14:51.820 --> 14:53.220
Get a grip!

14:53.220 --> 14:54.390
Come on!

14:54.390 --> 14:55.450
Unbelievable.

14:56.460 --> 14:59.830
To think they were harvesting
us for Earth's future...

14:59.830 --> 15:02.160
I wonder what's happening on Earth...

15:04.430 --> 15:06.230
What are you doing with that?

15:06.230 --> 15:08.930
- I'm going back.
- Back? How?

15:11.610 --> 15:13.440
I hate getting into messes.

15:14.680 --> 15:17.410
You knew about them, didn't you.

15:17.410 --> 15:18.550
Why keep quiet?

15:18.550 --> 15:19.880
It makes no money.

15:19.880 --> 15:21.750
What are we being harvested for?

15:22.820 --> 15:25.150
What's the difference
between men and women?

15:26.350 --> 15:27.720
The reproductive organs?

15:28.720 --> 15:32.060
They continue to live by
taking parts of our bodies

15:32.060 --> 15:34.030
and patching them together.

15:34.030 --> 15:37.030
Because we're all
the same: Earthlings.

15:37.030 --> 15:38.070
You heard, right?

15:38.070 --> 15:40.030
We're all parts.

15:40.030 --> 15:42.070
We were born only to be killed.

15:42.070 --> 15:45.110
Various planets were
used to create organs

15:45.110 --> 15:47.640
they needed in the ideal environment.

15:47.640 --> 15:49.670
In other words, they're all farms.

15:50.910 --> 15:53.150
My job is being a sheepdog.

15:53.150 --> 15:55.180
I run around doing business

15:55.180 --> 15:57.120
while selling information to Earth.

15:58.220 --> 16:00.490
That's how I survived.

16:00.490 --> 16:01.890
You sold us off?

16:03.760 --> 16:05.530
What would you do if I did?

16:05.530 --> 16:06.890
Kill me?

16:06.890 --> 16:10.060
Well, dying's all
we're here to do in any case.

16:11.830 --> 16:14.300
He's really a despicable guy.

16:18.110 --> 16:19.210
Hibiki...

16:19.210 --> 16:20.370
What are you doing?

16:22.180 --> 16:26.210
I'll do what I can do now... to survive.

16:26.210 --> 16:28.680
To show proof that I existed.

16:28.680 --> 16:30.620
Nothing starts unless we live.

16:30.620 --> 16:31.610
Right?

16:34.320 --> 16:35.720
You look good like that.

16:35.720 --> 16:36.960
Earthlings...

16:36.960 --> 16:39.790
Me and Mr. Alien are the same...

16:39.790 --> 16:41.060
We're the same.

16:46.230 --> 16:47.530
Wait a minute.

16:47.530 --> 16:49.470
Are you running away?

16:49.470 --> 16:51.210
I hate getting into messes.

16:51.210 --> 16:54.480
Those who only look behind
them don't get anywhere.

16:54.480 --> 16:57.080
You think flowers bear fruit if they die?

16:57.080 --> 16:59.450
Of course, you don't want to, right?

16:59.450 --> 17:01.550
Yes, unfortunately for you.

17:01.550 --> 17:04.450
Then I'm sure we'll meet again.

17:04.450 --> 17:05.890
How despicable!

17:05.890 --> 17:07.650
That's why I hate men!

17:10.190 --> 17:12.390
It's not something that
just started, right?

17:13.630 --> 17:15.720
You can't possibly be attached to them?

17:17.830 --> 17:20.470
That treasure isn't
something that'll disappear...

17:20.470 --> 17:21.870
just because of this.

17:36.850 --> 17:37.990
They're here.

17:37.990 --> 17:40.490
My team and Barnette's team
will engage the enemy

17:40.490 --> 17:43.460
while Jura's team guards the Nirvana.

17:43.460 --> 17:44.750
Roger!

17:59.610 --> 18:00.770
Dita, eyes front!

18:09.250 --> 18:10.350
Leader!

18:10.350 --> 18:11.850
Dita, watch out.

18:11.850 --> 18:13.510
They're predicting our movements.

18:15.090 --> 18:16.320
No!

18:18.390 --> 18:21.430
- Formation has been broken!
- The Paksis field is unstable!

18:21.430 --> 18:23.420
It looks tougher than usual.

18:24.630 --> 18:27.730
Oh no! The Nirvana's orbit
is starting to shift!

18:27.730 --> 18:29.070
What?

18:29.070 --> 18:33.840
The planet at 10 o'clock is
creating a huge magnetic field.

18:33.840 --> 18:36.910
The Nirvana is slowly
being drawn into it!

18:36.910 --> 18:39.280
The gas present is very high density.

18:39.280 --> 18:42.450
At this rate, we'll see
abnormalities with the system...

18:42.450 --> 18:44.350
Not at a time like this...

18:53.290 --> 18:55.730
What is this? I can't face that!

19:14.720 --> 19:16.650
Don't worry. It's a small wound.

19:17.920 --> 19:19.490
Sorry to keep you waiting!

19:19.490 --> 19:21.820
The genius navigator is here!

19:21.820 --> 19:24.520
You're late! What are you
doing showing up so late?

19:25.930 --> 19:27.020
Sorry for that.

19:28.600 --> 19:31.430
That's right...
There's only one thing we can do!

19:34.300 --> 19:36.000
W-Why now?

19:42.710 --> 19:44.610
Dita, fall back and regroup!

19:50.680 --> 19:51.670
That's...

19:54.220 --> 19:55.210
No way!

19:59.790 --> 20:00.780
Why?

20:13.170 --> 20:14.770
Fakes!

20:17.510 --> 20:21.050
They've actually gotten
so far as to copy those...

20:21.050 --> 20:23.780
To think the situation
would go this way...

20:23.780 --> 20:27.480
Those on our home planet would
never have dreamt of this.

20:31.860 --> 20:32.990
Lord Grand Pa.

20:32.990 --> 20:35.760
We've received a message
from female pirates.

20:38.500 --> 20:39.800
Lady Grand Ma.

20:39.800 --> 20:42.930
We received this from
the missing pirates...

20:45.570 --> 20:46.600
Excuse me.

20:55.480 --> 20:56.680
"Delete"

21:05.390 --> 21:07.920
Return to the Nirvana!
All teams, retreat!

21:13.530 --> 21:15.230
Mr. Alien!

21:19.870 --> 21:21.440
Don't get in my way!

21:21.440 --> 21:22.680
I'll live...

21:22.680 --> 21:24.110
I will survive!

21:32.150 --> 21:37.760
Hey, you realized what the words,

21:37.760 --> 21:43.260
I really wanted to hear are, right?

21:43.260 --> 21:49.500
I was looking at your profile as
you talked about the distant future.

21:49.500 --> 21:59.810
Take me with you to the depths of dreams.

21:59.810 --> 22:02.350
Hey, with all of my body.

22:02.350 --> 22:14.130
A pistol named love shoots
through the center of my chest.

22:14.130 --> 22:25.740
Negotiations and common
sense hold no meaning at all.

22:25.740 --> 22:37.550
Pull the trigger named love and
shoot through my frozen heart.

22:37.550 --> 22:51.420
Pour in your love
to the tips of my fingers.
